sequenceDiagram
    participant Ceremony as Keygen ceremony
    participant Partners as Partners
    participant Pub as Public material
    participant Enclave as Teecryptor or ZK Verifier

    Note over Ceremony: generates the keyset in-enclave,<br/>splits secrets with Shamir (3-of-6)
    Ceremony->>Partners: one share per partner, split per consumer
    Ceremony->>Pub: publish the public material
    Note over Ceremony: terminates, whole key<br/>never persisted
    Note over Partners,Enclave: later, at every component boot
    Enclave->>Partners: cofhe-keys asks, with the image attestation
    Note over Partners: each partner verifies independently
    Partners-->>Enclave: its own share, only to the approved image
    Note over Enclave: reconstruct in memory,<br/>zeroize transit material
